{"_id":"68a7360d8ec3d8323af12b06","nodeId":"JNilHFQnnVDOz-Gz6eNo5","roadmapSlug":"blockchain","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:06:53.730Z","description":"# Polygon\n\nPolygon is a framework for building and connecting Ethereum-compatible blockchain networks. It aims to aggregate scalable solutions on Ethereum, supporting a multi-chain Ethereum ecosystem. It essentially provides tools to create custom blockchain networks that can connect to Ethereum, offering faster and cheaper transactions while still benefiting from Ethereum's security and ecosystem.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"Introduction to Polygon","url":"https://wiki.polygon.technology/","_id":"6a7f4f5dcb44947debd1a299"},{"type":"official","title":"Polygon zkEVM","url":"https://polygon.technology/polygon-zkevm","_id":"6a7f4f5dcb44947debd1a29a"},{"type":"official","title":"Polygon PoS","url":"https://polygon.technology/polygon-pos","_id":"6a7f4f5dcb44947debd1a29b"},{"type":"official","title":"Polygon CDK","url":"https://polygon.technology/polygon-cdk","_id":"6a7f4f5dcb44947debd1a29c"},{"type":"official","title":"Polygon ID","url":"https://polygon.technology/polygon-id","_id":"6a7f4f5dcb44947debd1a29d"},{"type":"official","title":"Polygon POL whitepaper","url":"https://polygon.technology/papers/pol-whitepaper","_id":"6a7f4f5dcb44947debd1a29e"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:24:45.750Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/blockchain/content/JNilHFQnnVDOz-Gz6eNo5.md"}